     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " evaluate within 3 to 5 days of birth and within 48 to 72 hours after discharge, including feeding and jaundice; formal breastfeeding evaluation for breastfeeding newborns; discharged less than 48 hours after delivery: examine within 48 hours of discharge."
